    {
      "NamespaceHash": "Content::659688144",
      "Source": "There is a 1 % chance for a dino to get one health stat mutation, provided the following conditions are met:<#RN#>‑ It is a baby with maturation progress < 5 %.<#RN#>‑ Health mutation points < 254.<#RN#>‑ Total level < 360.",
      "Trans": {"SC":"恐龙有1%的几率获得一个生命值属性变异，前提是满足以下条件：<#RN#>‑ 它是幼崽且发育进度 < 5%。<#RN#>‑ 生命值变异点数 < 254。<#RN#>‑ 总等级 < 360。","JA":""},
      "Config": {"Item":false,"Dino":false,"Default_Hash":""}
    },
